# Cloudflare Pages routing.
#
# /music is the shareable name for the mixtape — the link that gets sent
# to someone so they can hear the record. A 200 here is a rewrite, not a
# redirect: the browser stays on /music and Pages serves the file. That
# keeps one canonical URL in the address bar, in the share sheet, and in
# whatever chat thread it was pasted into.
#
# /mixtape.html is left working rather than redirected. It is the path
# every previously-shared link already carries, and a rewrite target that
# also redirects is how you build an edge loop.
/music      /mixtape.html   200
/music/     /mixtape.html   200
